      "writtenOn": "2024-01-03T16:59:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yea I was talking about cases with 3 or more redundant stops. Actually I was just looking at Ganesh\u0027s interval representation and wondering if that\u0027s something we should consider for Graphite, but I suppose that\u0027s also independent of this CL.",
      "parentUuid": "eaa7c64b_0bdeffe9",
      "revId": "6d5d7e8b6a5eeb9c9cefc1342833aff48b7274e6",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
